:\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kMwOmLNspRtN7y8cAMnta9YijIs.jpg\"},{\"id\":3803200,\"name\":\"Yuna Nishimura\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3803201,\"name\":\"Hidemi Hikita\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":508442,\"title\":\"Soul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hm58Jw4Lw8OIeECIq5qyPYhAeRJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rQaHA74pevnGsxcKGaoZVGWe9TC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5123,\"title\":\"August Rush\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oA6ZeICPINiS6YtD5WZeBaGVmuT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i3pONuqGZSR3UYOOdBeU2CiQnxj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Evan, a musically gifted orphan, runs away from his orphanage and searches New York City for his birth parents. On his journey, he's taken under the wing of the Wizard, a homeless man who lives in an abandoned theater. After discovering his talent, the Wizard gives Evan the name \\\"August Rush\\\" and devises a plan to profit from his talent. Little does Evan know that his parents, Lyla and Louis, are searching for him too.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9816,\"title\":\"Save the Last Dance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sV8GIxT3BjHIiwgKUNwk1S8VSLa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gy3ZWhNom6hZ1NsUDwfOKS7YDrx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the death of her mother, Sara moves to the South Side of Chicago to live with her father and gets transferred to a majority-black school. Her life takes a turn for the better when she befriends siblings Chenille and Derek, who help her with her dancing skills.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18126,\"title\":\"Hannah Montana: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iVQPlpZUeQh4nh8bDnMLLhXifAN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sGqepjVCkXeG7IDPNnvpT8G3AyW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Miley Stewart (aka pop-star Hannah Montana) gets too caught up in the superstar celebrity lifestyle, her dad decides it's time for a total change of scenery. But sweet niblets! Miley must trade in all the glitz and glamour of Hollywood for some ol' blue jeans on the family farm in Tennessee, and question if she can be both Miley Stewart and Hannah Montana.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":89185,\"title\":\"Radio Rebel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wycDdx2BrdNKlyTZoZT8uLeu6dq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nuhKYERTbwHmQPoqhl2AuzP2XPM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"High school senior Tara is so painfully shy that she dreads speaking to anyone in the hallways or getting called on in class. But in the privacy of her bedroom with her iPod in hand, she rocks out -- doing mock broadcasts for Miami's hottest FM radio station, which happens to be owned by her stepfather. When a slot opens up at The SLAM, Tara surprises herself by blossoming behind the mike into confident, \\\"Radio Rebel\\\" -- and to everyone's shock, she's a hit!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14024,\"title\":\"Raise Your Voice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/89sfBkVOsgFRPs6uKaBtSMCDSv3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jpxKKX36mVUxV6gdOxPDSSsc2SA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A coming-of-age story centered around a small-town singer brokenhearted by the death of her brother in a car crash, who had secretly submitted her for a summer session at a performing arts academy in Los Angeles. In the academy, she experiences a whole new way of life in the big city, far from the small town lifestyle she's used to.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":738215,\"title\":\"Barbie: Princess Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6RTLyTq3or1d6VakzG2gq3W4Dxa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cmZVWuXM1hpP2GKFABCUkoscKu4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With new friends in a new kingdom, Barbie learns what it means to be herself when she trades places with a royal lookalike in this musical adventure.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Music\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":32293,\"title\":\"The Cheetah Girls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7XOJqR8WErIm1ZqytABCEuUke1C.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qJVUx5xUes9cTDpMiNWx4Fab2ac.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A four-member teen girl group named the Cheetah Girls go to a Manhattan High School for the Performing Arts and try to become the first freshmen to win the talent show in the school's history. During the talent show auditions, they meet a big-time producer named Jackal Johnson, who tries to make the group into superstars, but the girls run into many problems.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":412519,\"title\":\"Honey 3: Dare to Dance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m4K7iMnPRL6wGpwrGuFtCFv8h3M.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cUGnrZdgkUITZ6AGO4IKKluht8w.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While attending college in Cape Town, Melea Martin feels constrained by the school's strict policies, and decides to set out on her own. Searching for a way to use her talents as a dancer and inspire the community around her, Melea rents a failing theater in order to put on a Hip-Hop Romeo and Juliet performance. But much like the Capulets and Montagues, conflicts between cast members threaten to bring the whole performance to a halt...\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":498402,\"title\":\"Aline\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9FC1wqVpaWvaIcAbu6bIYgFDu1z.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vlrRGSoCpoSoVzX9Y1JS6rni3Ym.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fictionalized biopic of Aline Dieu, a multitalented singer from a musically inclined family.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"wSEnh8Hi62E\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"OR2f2a46n8k\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"-CbFQ_AhFsc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}